  "Cosmic Smash Lv.$1": "",
  "Cosmic Smash <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, gain $2 points of <link\\=\"s|252\"><u>[Mobilize Energy]</u></link> and enter [Smash] state until the end of her next turn.\\n[Smash]: At the end of YUI's turn, activate Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], command all Vegetable Knights to deal Nuke damage to 1 random foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, then activate the following effects based on the current color state:\\nWhen [Eggplant Purple] is active, gain $4 point of <link\\=\"s|252\"><u>[Mobilize Energy]</u></link>;\\nWhen [Potato Yellow] is active, YUI gains [Tuber Power], increase <link\\=\"s|299\"><u>[{{A}} DMG]</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns.\\nWhen [Mushroom Pink] is activate, inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\nWhen [Asparagus Green] is activate, restore $9 HP to the lowest HP ally.\\nIf YUI has Potato Knight after using this skill, change to <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>[Potato Yellow]</u></link> state at the end of YUI's action.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>With a sudden bounce, Potato Knight zoomed across and instantly exploded upon impact, scattering rainbow-colored specks like candy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=19>Vegetable Knights: Assemble Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=19>Vegetable Knights: Assemble <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Increase YUI's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns. Summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a <link\\=\"s|257\"><u>specific order</u></link>. After using this skill, YUI can use other skills, this doesn't count as a {{A}} skill. \\nPassive: At the start of turn, automatically summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a <link\\=\"s|257\"><u>specific order</u></link>. \\nYUI can only have $4 Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight, and $5 Potato Knights.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The Vegetable Knights are about to make a dazzling entrance, it seems they can't wait to showcase their skills on the cosmic battlefield!</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=20>Vegetable Knights: Mobilize Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=20>Vegetable Knights: Mobilize <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, for every $2 Vegetable Knight, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. When YUI has $5 or more Potato Knights, spend additional Potato Knights, for every $6 Potato Knight spent, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> of ATK. This skill damage counts as an {{B}} damage. When YUI manually uses this skill, gain $9 points of [Mobilize Energy].\\nPassive: When YUI has $10 or more [Mobilize Energy] points, she can spend all [Mobilize Energy] to deal the damage from [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize], distribute this damage between all foes, this doesn't count as {{A}} skill damage.\\nIf YUI has Eggplant Knight after using this skill, change to <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>[Eggplant Purple]</u></link> state at the end of YUI's action.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A thrilling free-for-all begins as the Vegetable Knights charge forward together, their small figures darting swiftly across the battlefield, victory will be ours!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and immediately activate <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>[Vegetable Knights: Strike]</u></link> on that foe based on <link\\=\"s|258\"><u>specific rules</u></link>.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knight</u></link>, increase YUI's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>, up to $3 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link>.": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knight</u></link>, increase YUI's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>, up to $3 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link>.": "",
  "Increase <link\\=\"s|299\"><u>[{{B}} DMG]</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>.\\nWhen YUI is part of an {{B}}, increase that {{B}}'s damage based on the total amount of <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link> YUI has.": "",
  "Increase <link\\=\"s\\|299\"><u>[{{B}} DMG]</u></link> by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>.\\nWhen YUI is part of an {{B}}, increase that {{B}}'s damage based on the total amount of <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link> YUI has.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Mobilize Energy]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource. Gained from skills. When YUI has $1 or more [Mobilize Energy] points, she can spend all [Mobilize Energy] to deal the damage from [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize], distribute this damage between all foes.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Potato Yellow]</color>": "",
  "YUI changes into Potato Knight's yellow.\\nBasic ability: Increase YUI's {{B}} DMG.\\nAfter activating Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], increase {{B}} DMG.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Eggplant Purple</color>": "",
  "YUI changes into Eggplant Knight's purple.\\nBasic ability: After using a Persona skill, gain $1 additional point of [Mobilize Energy].\\nWhen activating Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], gain $2 point of [Mobilize Energy].": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Mushroom Pink]</color>": "",
  "YUI changes into Mushroom Knight's pink.\\nBasic ability: When dealing {{B}} skill damage and {{C}} damage, there is a chance to inflict Brainwash on the skill target for $1 turn.\\nAfter activating Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Asparagus Green]</color>": "",
  "YUI changes into Asparagus Knight's green.\\nBasic ability: When dealing {{B}} skill damage and {{C}} damage, restore YUI's HP.\\nAfter activating Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], restore HP to the lowest HP ally.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Tuber Power]</color>": "",
  "When [Potato Yellow] is active and YUI activates Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], gains [Tuber Power], increase {{B}} DMG.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Vegetable Knights]</color>": "",
  "YUI can summon Eggplant Knight, Potato Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight in battle. YUI can only have $1 Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight, and $2 Potato Knights.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Smash]</color>": "",
  "When YUI uses [Cosmic Smash], gain [Smash] state for $1 turns.\\n[Smash]: At the end of YUI's turn, activate Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], command all Vegetable Knights to deal Nuke damage to 1 random foe, then activate the following effects based on the current color state:\\nWhen [Eggplant Purple] is active, gain $2 point of [Mobilize Energy];\\nWhen [Potato Yellow] is active, YUI gains [Tuber Power], increase {{B}} DMG;\\nWhen [Mushroom Pink] is activate, inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken;\\nWhen [Asparagus Green] is activate, restore HP to the lowest HP ally.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Specific Summon Order</color>": "",
  "When YUI doesn't have 4 kinds of Vegetable Knights, summon them in the order of Eggplant Knight, Potato Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight; When YUI has 4 kinds of Vegetable Knights, she will only summon Potato Knights.\\nWhen YUI summon Eggplant Knight from [Vegetable Knights: Assemble] for the first time, change to [Eggplant Purple].": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Specific Rules</color>": "",
  "Based on the following priority, YUI will activate a different [Vegetable Knight: Strike] after using HIGHLIGHT:\\n1. When the HIGHLIGHT target isn't inflicted with [Mushroom Spores] and YUI has Mushroom Knight, activate [Mushroom Pink] state [Vegetable Knight: Strike];\\n2. When YUI doesn't have [Tuber Power] and has Potato Knight, activate [Potato Yellow] state [Vegetable Knight: Strike];\\n3. When YUI has Eggplant Knight, activate [Eggplant Purple] state [Vegetable Knight: Strike];\\n4. When YUI has no Vegetable Knights, do not activate [Vegetable Knight: Strike].": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Vegetable Knights: Mobilize]</color>": "",
  "Deal damage to foe based on the total amount of Vegetable Knights. This skill damage counts as an {{B}} damage.\\nWhen YUI manually uses this skill, gain $1 points of [Mobilize Energy].\\nPassive: When YUI has $2 [Mobilize Energy] points, she can spend all [Mobilize Energy] to deal the damage from [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize], distribute this damage between all foes.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Vegetable Knights: Strike]</color>": "",
  "When [Smash] is active, at the end of YUI's turn, activate Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], command all Vegetable Knights to deal Nuke damage to $1 random foe, then activate the following effects based on the current color state:\\nWhen [Eggplant Purple] is active, gain $2 point of [Mobilize Energy];\\nWhen [Potato Yellow] is active, YUI gains [Tuber Power], increase All-Out Attack DMG.\\nWhen [Mushroom Pink] is activate, inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken.\\nWhen [Asparagus Green] is activate, restore HP to the lowest HP ally.": "",
  "Doki Doki Sprout Legion": "",
  "YUI can summon Eggplant Knight, Potato Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight and gain [Mobilize Energy] in battle. When YUI has enough [Mobilize Energy], she can order the Vegetable Knights to use [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize] on foes, this skill damage counts as All-Out Attack damage.\\nWhen YUI has a different Vegetable Knight, she can change her Phantom Thief Attire to match the corresponding Knight and gain bonuses:\\n[Eggplant Purple]: After using a {{B}} skill, gain $1 additional point of [Mobilize Energy];\\n[Potato Yellow]: Increase YUI's All-Out Attack damage by $2;\\n[Mushroom Pink]: When dealing damage with a Persona skill/All-Out Attack, there is a $3 base chance to inflict Brainwash on the target for $4 turn.\\n[Asparagus Green]: When dealing damage with a Persona skill/All-Out Attack, restore YUI's HP by $5 of damage dealt (up to $6 HP).": "",
  "YUI can summon Eggplant Knight, Potato Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight and gain [Mobilize Energy] in battle. When YUI has enough [Mobilize Energy], she can order the Vegetable Knights to use [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize] on foes, this skill damage counts as All-Out Attack damage.\\nWhen YUI has a different Vegetable Knight, she can change her Phantom Thief Attire to match the corresponding Knight and gain bonuses:\\n[Eggplant Purple]: After using a {{B}} skill, gain $1 additional point of [Mobilize Energy];\\n[Potato Yellow]: Increase YUI's <link\\=\"s|299\"><u>[{{C}} DMG]</u></link> by $2;\\n[Mushroom Pink]: When dealing damage with a Persona skill/All-Out Attack, there is a $3 base chance to inflict Brainwash on the target for $4 turn.\\n[Asparagus Green]: When dealing damage with a Persona skill/All-Out Attack, restore YUI's HP by $5 of damage dealt (up to $6 HP).": "",
  "Deep Space Defenders": "",
  "At the start of battle, YUI will immediately summon 4 different <link\\=\"s\\|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link> and gain max <link\\=\"s\\|252\"><u>[Mobilize Energy]</u></link> stacks.\\nFor every $1 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knight</u></link>, increase YUI's Crit DMG by $2, up to $3 <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Vegetable Knights</u></link>.\\nAt the start of battle, <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>[Potato Yellow]</u></link> is active. At the start of YUI's first turn, change to <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>[Eggplant Purple]</u></link>.": "",
  "The Last Potato": "",
  "YUI gains $1 more Potato Knight that can't be spent, increase <link\\=\"s|260\"><u>[Tuber Power]</u></link> from Follow Up <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>[Vegetable Knights: Strike]</u></link> by $2. At the start of battle, gain <link\\=\"s|260\"><u>[Tuber Power]</u></link> for $3 turns.": "",
  "Dark Farm Hypothesis": "",
  "<size\\=21>The Traveler's Guide to the Stars</size>": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enchanced: Increase user's ATK by $1 for $2 turns.": "",
  "The Super Dimension Fleet": "",
  "Galactic Celebration": "",
  "Unlock <color\\=#38E3FF>[</color><color\\=#9932CC>Prism</color><color\\=#FBB317>atic</color> <color\\=#EE82EE>Win</color><color\\=#0EE514>gs</color><color\\=#38E3FF>]</color> state, [Prismatic Wings] has the ability of <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>[Eggplant Purple]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>[Potato Yellow]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|255\"><u>[Mushroom Pink]</u></link>, and <link\\=\"s|256\"><u>[Asparagus Green]</u></link>.\\nAt the start of battle, <link\\=\"s|261\"><u>[Smash]</u></link> state is active. This effect is permanent.\\nChange <link\\=\"s|261\"><u>[Smash]</u></link> effect to: At the end of all allies' turn, activate Follow Up <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>[Vegetable Knights: Strike]</u></link>.\\nWhen YUI manually uses [Vegetable Knights: Assemble], summon 1 more Potato Knight.": "",
  "{{A}} can inflict [Frost]. When allies attack foes with [Rime], activate [Cruel Edge].": "",
  "Ice Blossom": "",
  "Arctic Storm": "",
  "Glacial Lunge": "",
  "Blizzard Edge": "",
  "Cruel Edge": "",
  "Order": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and inflict $2 [Frost] stacks on target. Decrease target's DEF by $4 for every $3 ATK * [Frost] stacks (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> ATK) for $6 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Sharp ice spikes, like a predator's claws, swiftly pierce the earth. Following a deep, cracking sound, sharp fragments scatter in all directions, dealing Ice damage to foe.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Inflict 1 foe with [Queen's Gaze]. Decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>, also decrease DEF by $3 for every $2 ATK (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK) and increase DMG Taken by $6 for every every $5 ATK (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> ATK). This effect is permanent. Only 1 [Queen's Gaze] can be active. When selecting a new target, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the new target. When the target with [Queen's Gaze] is defeated, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the highest HP foe. When passing [Queen's Gaze], pass all debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru. Mitsuru can use other skills, this doesn't count as a Persona skill.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A piercing storm sweeps across the area, freezing the air solid. Foes are rapidly frozen into ice, as the relentless frost deals terrifying Ice damage.": "",
  "Increase party's stats by $1 of Elucidator's stats for $2 turns. Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, for every $4 [Frost] stack on target, increase <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $5. When target have $6 [Frost] stacks, increase skill Crit Rate by $7.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The queen of winter raises her rapier. The moment its tip pierces foe, icy cracks spread from the wound. Frost and flesh intertwine, delivering a fatal blow.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Blizzard Edge: Use condition: When Mitsuru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Upgrade target's [Frost] to <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> for $3 turns. When allies use a Persona skill to attack foes with <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link>, activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>[Cruel Edge]</u></link>. [Cruel Edge]: Deal damage to 1 foe equal to [Frost] stacks * <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Inflict 1 foe with [Energy Mark]. Lasts for $5 turns. When S.E.E.S. members attack that foe for the first time, restore $6 Theurgy Energy to that member; When non S.E.E.S. members attack that foe for the first time, restore $7 HIGHLIGHT Energy.": "",
  "Blizzard Edge: Use condition: When Mitsuru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Upgrade target's [Frost] to <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> for $3 turns. When allies use a Persona skill to attack foes with <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link>, activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>[Cruel Edge]</u></link>. [Cruel Edge]: Deal damage to 1 foe equal to [Frost] stacks * <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Inflict 1 foe with [Energy Mark]. Lasts for $5 turns. When allies with Theurgy attack that foe for the first time, restore $6 Theurgy Energy to that ally; When allies with HIGHLIGHT attack that foe for the first time, restore $7 HIGHLIGHT Energy.": "",
  "At the start of battle, decrease Elucidator's cooldown time by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> turns.": "",
  "At the start of battle, decrease Elucidator's cooldown time by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> turns.": "",
  "When Mitsuru is present, all Assassin/Sweeper increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> per [Frost] stacks when attacking foes with [Frost].": "",
  "When Mitsuru is present, all Assassin/Sweeper increase damage by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> per [Frost] stacks when attacking foes with [Frost].": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Rime]</color>": "",
  "Can activate all [Frost] effects.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Cruel Edge]</color>": "",
  "Deal damage to 1 foe equal to [Frost] stacks * a certain amount of ATK. This damage will perfectly replicate all combat stats of the activator (ATK, DMG Bonus, Crit Rate, Crit DMG, Pierce), skill attribute is identical to the activator's attack skill.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Stasis]</color>": "",
  "Can activate all [Frost] and [Rime] effects.": "",
  "President's Duty": "",
  "When Mitsuru deals {{B}} skill damage or {{C}} damage, inflict $1 [Frost] stack on target for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times. When Mitsuru attacks foes with [Frost], increase ATK by $4 * [Frost] stacks. When allies use a Persona skill to attack foes with <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link>, activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>[Cruel Edge]</u></link>.": "",
  "Brilliant!": "",
  "At the start of battle, inflict all foes with $1 <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> stacks that can exceed the cap. Stacks up to $2 times. This effect is permanent. Foes with <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> increase Crit Rate Taken by $3.": "",
  "Fencing Queen": "",
  "Foes with [Queen's Gaze] increase Crit DMG Taken by $1. When passing [Queen's Gaze], pass all debuffs.": "",
  "Execution!": "",
  "Behind the Lies": "",
  "Increase Theurgy damage by $1. Theurgy increase target's DMG Taken by $2 more for $3 turns.": "",
  "The Awkward Side": "",
  "Burning Spirit": "",
  "Increase the maximum number of [Frost] stacks to $1. Double Mitsuru's base Theurgy Energy recovery. When using Theurgy, Mitsuru can upgrade target's <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> to <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link> for $2 turns. When allies attack foes with <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link>, additionally activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>[Cruel Edge]</u></link> at $3 of the original attack's damage. When Mitsuru attacks foes with <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link>, gain $4 Total DMG Amp.": "",
  "Increase the maximum number of [Frost] stacks to $1. Double Mitsuru's base Theurgy Energy recovery. When using Theurgy, Mitsuru can upgrade target's <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>[Rime]</u></link> to <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link> for $2 turns. When allies use a Persona skill to attack foes with <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link>, additionally activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>[Cruel Edge]</u></link> at $3 of the original attack's damage. When Mitsuru attacks foes with <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>[Stasis]</u></link>, gain $4 Total DMG Amp.": "",
  "{{A}} can select $1 bonus character as the [Backup Character]": "",
  "You did not select the Backup Character. Proceed?": "",
  "Radiant Power": "",
  "Holy Prayer": "",
  "Spirit Wave": "",
  "Oracle Shift": "",
  "Benevolence": "",
  "Compassion": "",
  "Increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>, and damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + $7 for every $6 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color>. Lasts for $9 turns. User gains $10 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stack.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A dazzling brilliance flows from her fingertips, enveloping her allies. From this moment, every strike is endowed with new radiant power.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Initial Cooldown Time: $1 ally actions\\nIncrease party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> + $4 for every $3 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Lasts for $6 turns. If main target is a S.E.E.S. member, restore target's Theurgy Energy by $7 points, then increase target's Theurgy damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> + $10 for every $9 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color>. Lasts for $12 turns; If the main target is not a S.E.E.S. member, restore HIGHLIGHT Energy by $13 points, then increase target's HIGHLIGHT damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> + $16 for every $15 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to $17.\\nThis skill has an independent cooldown and does not affect the cooldown time of other skills.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>As if blessed by the will of a deity, a sacred light surges from her, carrying immense power and granting her allies fearless might.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Increase party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 of Fuuka's Crit DMG, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>. Lasts for $5 turns. User gains $6 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stacks.\\nWhen any ally meets the following conditions, activate one of the following effect in order of priority. (When no conditions are met, activate 1 random effect)\\n1. When any ally is inflicted with Mental Ailments, cure $7 debuff on the target.\\n2. When any ally is below $8 max HP, restore HP equal to $9 of that ally's max HP.\\n3. When any ally is below $10 SP, restore $11 SP to the lowest SP ally.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Hearts and minds converge, fluctuating energy radiates from the warm light, swirling around each ally, awakening the strength buried deep within their souls.</color></size></b>": "",
  "After any ally uses a Theurgy or HIGHLIGHT, increase party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns.": "",
  "After any ally uses a Theurgy or HIGHLIGHT, increase party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns.": "",
  "Increase party's stats by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link>'s stats.": "",
  "Increase party's stats by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> of <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link>'s stats.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Wish Listener]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource. Used to use the special skill [Oracle Shift].": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Oracle Shift]</color>": "",
  "Spend $1 [Wish Listener] stacks. The acting [Current Character] become inactive, the [Backup Character] become active and take 1 action. After this action, the [Backup Character] become inactive, and the [Current Character] become active to continue their turn. \\nWhen the [Backup Character] is active, they copy all status effects from the [Current Character] except those they applied to themselves. These are cleared when the [Backup Character] become inactive. When the [Backup Character] first become active, activate all [Start of Battle] effects. When the [Backup Character] become inactive, do not affect the duration of effects with turn limits.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Combat Turn</color>": "",
  "After all alive allies take 1 non-Extra Action action, count as 1 combat turn.": "",
  "After all alive allies take 1 action, count as 1 combat turn.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Backup Character</color>": "",
  "Only after {{A}} is in the party, you can select 1 non-deployed character as {{A}}'s [Backup Character]; The [Backup Character] don't count as being in the party, and will not interact with start of battle attribute, role, character number, etc;": "",
  "Steadfast Supporter": "",
  "In party menu, Fuuka can select 1 non-Wonder ally as the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link>. During battle, Fuuka can spend [Wish Listener] to use [Oracle Shift] and make the [Backup Character] active and act. Fuuka can use [Oracle Shift] once after $2 <link\\=\"s|269\"><u>[Combat Turn]</u></link>.\\nAt the start of battle, Fuuka gains 1/2/3 [Wish Listener] stacks (effect increases at level 1/50/70). Stacks up to $3 times.\\n<link\\=\"s|268\"><u>[Oracle Shift]</u></link>: Spend $4 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stacks. The acting [Current Character] become inactive, the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> become active and take 1 action. After this action, the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> become inactive, and the [Current Character] become active to continue their turn. \\nWhen the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> is active, they copy all status effects from the [Current Character] except those they applied to themselves. These are cleared when the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> become inactive. When the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> first become active, activate all [Start of Battle] effects. When the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> become inactive, do not affect the duration of effects with turn limits. After the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> is active for the first time, decrease their skill cooldown after every <link\\=\"s|269\"><u>[Combat Turn]</u></link>.": "",
  "Where I Belong": "",
  "At the start of battle, Fuuka gains $1 bonus <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stacks. Increase max stacks of <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> to $2.\\nAfter using a skill, increase party's Crit Rate by $3 for $4 turns. Stacks up to $5 times.": "",
  "Strengths and Weaknesses": "",
  "After using <link\\=\"s|268\"><u>[Oracle Shift]</u></link>, the <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>[Backup Character]</u></link> immediately use their Theurgy or HIGHLIGHT once. This effect has a $1 <link\\=\"s|269\"><u>[Combat Turns]</u></link> cooldown.\\nAfter using <link\\=\"s|268\"><u>[Oracle Shift]</u></link>, increase party's <link\\=\"s|236\"><u>Total DMG Amp</u></link> by $2 for $3 turn.\\nWhen any ally is below $4 max HP, immediately restore HP equal to $5 of that ally's max HP, and restore HP equal to $6 of that ally's max HP for $7 turns. This effect can be activated once per battle.": "",
  "The Sustainer": "",
  "Tower Guide": "",
  "When any ally uses a HIGHLIGHT or Theurgy, increase their HIGHLIGHT or Theurgy damage by $1.": "",
  "Connecting the Dots": "",
  "Self-Worth": "",
  "Decrease <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> cost of <link\\=\"s|268\"><u>[Oracle Shift]</u></link> to 3 stacks.\\nWhen using [Holy Prayer], gain $2 bonus <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stacks.": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, gain $2 points of <link\\=\"s|252\"><u>[Mobilize Energy]</u></link> and enter [Smash] state until the end of her next turn.\\n[Smash]: At the end of YUI's turn, activate Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], command all Vegetable Knights to deal Nuke damage to 1 random foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, then activate the following effects based on the current color state:\\nWhen [Eggplant Purple] is active, gain $4 point of <link\\=\"s|252\"><u>[Mobilize Energy]</u></link>;\\nWhen [Potato Yellow] is active, YUI gains [Tuber Power], increase <link\\=\"s|299\"><u>[{{A}} DMG]</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns.\\nWhen [Mushroom Pink] is activate, inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\nWhen [Asparagus Green] is activate, restore $9 HP to the lowest HP ally.\\nIf YUI has Potato Knight after using this skill, change to <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>[Potato Yellow]</u></link> state at the end of YUI's action.": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, gain $2 points of [Mobilize Energy] and enter [Smash] state until the end of her next turn.\\n[Smash]: At the end of YUI's turn, activate Follow Up [Vegetable Knights: Strike], command all Vegetable Knights to deal Nuke damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> random foe equal to $3 of ATK, then activate the following effects based on the current color state:\\nWhen [Eggplant Purple] is active, gain $4 point of [Mobilize Energy];\\nWhen [Potato Yellow] is active, YUI gains [Tuber Power], increase {{A}} DMG by $5 for $6 turns.\\nWhen [Mushroom Pink] is activate, inflict skill target with [Mushroom Spores], increase DMG Taken by $7 for $8 turns.\\nWhen [Asparagus Green] is activate, restore $9 HP to the lowest HP ally.\\nIf YUI has Potato Knight after using this skill, change to [Potato Yellow] state at the end of YUI's action.": "",
  "Increase YUI's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns. Summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a <link\\=\"s|257\"><u>specific order</u></link>. After using this skill, YUI can use other skills, this doesn't count as a {{A}} skill. \\nPassive: At the start of turn, automatically summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a <link\\=\"s|257\"><u>specific order</u></link>. \\nYUI can only have $4 Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight, and $5 Potato Knights.": "",
  "Increase <color\\=#FFFF00>YUI's</color> ATK by $1 and Crit Rate by $2. Lasts for $3 turns. Summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a specific order. After using this skill, YUI can use other skills, this doesn't count as a {{A}} skill. \\nPassive: At the start of turn, automatically summon 1 Vegetable Knight in a specific order. \\nYUI can only have $4 Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, Asparagus Knight, and $5 Potato Knights.": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, for every $2 Vegetable Knight, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. When YUI has $5 or more Potato Knights, spend additional Potato Knights, for every $6 Potato Knight spent, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> of ATK. This skill damage counts as an {{B}} damage. When YUI manually uses this skill, gain $9 points of [Mobilize Energy].\\nPassive: When YUI has $10 or more [Mobilize Energy] points, she can spend all [Mobilize Energy] to deal the damage from [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize], distribute this damage between all foes, this doesn't count as {{A}} skill damage.\\nIf YUI has Eggplant Knight after using this skill, change to <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>[Eggplant Purple]</u></link> state at the end of YUI's action.": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, for every $2 Vegetable Knight, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to $4 of ATK. When YUI has $5 or more Potato Knights, spend additional Potato Knights, for every $6 Potato Knight spent, deal bonus Nuke damage equal to $8 of ATK. This skill damage counts as an {{B}} damage. When YUI manually uses this skill, gain $9 points of [Mobilize Energy].\\nPassive: When YUI has $10 or more [Mobilize Energy] points, she can spend all [Mobilize Energy] to deal the damage from [Vegetable Knights: Mobilize], distribute this damage between <color\\=#FFFF00>all foes</color>, this doesn't count as {{A}} skill damage.\\nIf YUI has Eggplant Knight after using this skill, change to [Eggplant Purple] state at the end of YUI's action.": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and immediately activate <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>[Vegetable Knights: Strike]</u></link> on that foe based on <link\\=\"s|258\"><u>specific rules</u></link>.": "",
