  "Deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, and inflict $2 [Frost] stacks on target. Decrease target's DEF by $4 for every $3 ATK * [Frost] stacks (up to $5 ATK) for $6 turns.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and inflict $2 [Frost] stacks on target. Decrease target's DEF by $4 for every $3 ATK * [Frost] stacks (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> ATK) for $6 turns.": "",
  "Inflict <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe with [Queen's Gaze]. Decrease DEF by $1, also decrease DEF by $3 for every $2 ATK (up to $4 ATK) and increase DMG Taken by $6 for every every $5 ATK (up to $7 ATK). This effect is permanent. Only 1 [Queen's Gaze] can be active. When selecting a new target, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the new target. When the target with [Queen's Gaze] is defeated, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the highest HP foe. When passing [Queen's Gaze], pass all debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru. Mitsuru can use other skills, this doesn't count as a Persona skill.": "",
  "Inflict 1 foe with [Queen's Gaze]. Decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>, also decrease DEF by $3 for every $2 ATK (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK) and increase DMG Taken by $6 for every every $5 ATK (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> ATK). This effect is permanent. Only 1 [Queen's Gaze] can be active. When selecting a new target, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the new target. When the target with [Queen's Gaze] is defeated, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the highest HP foe. When passing [Queen's Gaze], pass all debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru. Mitsuru can use other skills, this doesn't count as a Persona skill.": "",
  "Increase <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> stats by $1 of Elucidator's stats for $2 turns. Deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $3 of ATK, for every $4 [Frost] stack on target, increase skill damage by $5. When target have $6 [Frost] stacks, increase skill Crit Rate by $7.": "",
  "Increase party's stats by $1 of Elucidator's stats for $2 turns. Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, for every $4 [Frost] stack on target, increase <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $5. When target have $6 [Frost] stacks, increase skill Crit Rate by $7.": "",
  "Use condition: When Mitsuru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of ATK. Upgrade target's [Frost] to [Rime] for $3 turns. When allies use a Persona skill to attack foes with [Rime], activate [Cruel Edge]. [Cruel Edge]: Deal damage to 1 foe equal to [Frost] stacks * $4 of ATK.": "",
  "Inflict <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe with [Energy Mark]. Lasts for $1 turns. When S.E.E.S. members attack that foe for the first time, restore $2 Theurgy Energy to that member; When non S.E.E.S. members attack that foe for the first time, restore $3 HIGHLIGHT Energy.": "",
  "Inflict <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe with [Energy Mark]. Lasts for $1 turns. When allies with Theurgy attack that foe for the first time, restore $2 Theurgy Energy to that ally; When allies with HIGHLIGHT attack that foe for the first time, restore $3 HIGHLIGHT Energy.": "",
