  "Increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>, and damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + $7 for every $6 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color>. Lasts for $9 turns. User gains $10 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stack.": "",
  "Initial Cooldown Time: $1 ally actions\\nIncrease <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> ATK by $2 + $4 for every $3 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to $5. Lasts for $6 turns. If main target is a S.E.E.S. member, restore target's Theurgy Energy by $7 points, then increase target's Theurgy damage by $8 + $10 for every $9 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to $11. Lasts for $12 turns; If the main target is not a S.E.E.S. member, restore HIGHLIGHT Energy by $13 points, then increase target's HIGHLIGHT damage by $14 + $16 for every $15 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to $17.\\nThis skill has an independent cooldown and does not affect the cooldown time of other skills.": "",
  "Initial Cooldown Time: $1 ally actions\\nIncrease party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> + $4 for every $3 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Lasts for $6 turns. If main target is a S.E.E.S. member, restore target's Theurgy Energy by $7 points, then increase target's Theurgy damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> + $10 for every $9 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color>. Lasts for $12 turns; If the main target is not a S.E.E.S. member, restore HIGHLIGHT Energy by $13 points, then increase target's HIGHLIGHT damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> + $16 for every $15 points of Fuuka's ATK, up to $17.\\nThis skill has an independent cooldown and does not affect the cooldown time of other skills.": "",
  "Increase <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> Crit DMG by $1+ $3 for every $2 of Fuuka's Crit DMG, up to $4. Lasts for $5 turns. User gains $6 [Wish Listener] stacks.\\nWhen any ally meets the following conditions, activate one of the following effect in order of priority. (When no conditions are met, activate 1 random effect)\\n1. When any ally is inflicted with Mental Ailments, cure $7 debuff on the target.\\n2. When any ally is below $8 max HP, restore HP equal to $9 of that ally's max HP.\\n3. When any ally is below $10 SP, restore $11 SP to the lowest SP ally.": "",
  "Increase party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 of Fuuka's Crit DMG, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>. Lasts for $5 turns. User gains $6 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>[Wish Listener]</u></link> stacks.\\nWhen any ally meets the following conditions, activate one of the following effect in order of priority. (When no conditions are met, activate 1 random effect)\\n1. When any ally is inflicted with Mental Ailments, cure $7 debuff on the target.\\n2. When any ally is below $8 max HP, restore HP equal to $9 of that ally's max HP.\\n3. When any ally is below $10 SP, restore $11 SP to the lowest SP ally.": "",
